Yeah, for pure damage dealing to demons, it would be Frostbrand. (I
think it only gets bested by Grayswandir.) However, if it were me, I
would probably stick with the Staff. It doesn't get double damage
against demons, but does against most everything else, provides level-
drain resistance, which is a small benefit, and hungerless
regeneration which I consider a big benefit. Plus, it is just the
stylish thing to do for a healer. The only downside (other than no
shield) is you should pay attention to its BUC status and get it re-
blessed if it ever gets to Uncursed. Being stuck with a cursed two-
handed weapon is not fun.

